  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:large\"><span><span style=\"font-family:arial\">&nbsp;下載來自 Faye Garden 的<strong>全部 3 個附加元件</strong>，現在只需<strong>一個</strong>套件即可！</span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:xx-large\"><strong>裝飾套件</strong></span></div>\n</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue;font-size:large\">29 種可融入您 Minecraft 世界的裝飾物品。&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DMMrYWEL30o?si=xoklQNsED5tva4Qn\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:xx-large\"><strong>生物套件</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:large\">5 種獨特的生物可融入您的 Minecraft 世界。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jZYYAPaM4Rg?si=UusAePeJjFJ49o9S\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:xx-large\"><strong>自然音效套件</strong></span>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:large\">在您的 Faye Garden 世界中享受舒緩的自然音效。</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vYyVExEW5aE?si=txFM7rhfRPHgEaxH\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">在新版 26.1 更新中，玩家現在可以使用<strong>棍子</strong>來調整物品的<strong>旋轉角度</strong>，並使用<strong>羽毛</strong>來改變其<strong>位置</strong>；這對於製作雜項裝飾非常有用。&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">所有物品均可在<strong>石製切割機中使用棍子</strong>取得。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><em>請注意，部分物件尚未支援此功能，例如椅子。</em></div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>使用條款</strong></span></h1>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h3>1. 您&nbsp;<strong>不</strong>&nbsp;得重新分發材質、模型或附加元件，無論是否經過修改。</h3>\n<h3>2. 未經作者許可，您&nbsp;<strong>不</strong>&nbsp;得將本站發表的任何創作上傳至其他網站或同人網站。&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>3. 當發布圖片、&nbsp;影片、評論，或使用這些已發表作品進行任何形式遊玩並產生收益時：您必須同時附上發佈平台名稱及連結至本站的網址 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.thefayeproject.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.thefayeproject.com/</a>) 。&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>4. 所有透過多人伺服器或與朋友間接使用這些作品的參與者，亦須遵守本條款。&nbsp;</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>💌 回報錯誤：&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:contact@thefayeproject.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">contact@thefayeproject.com</a></em></h3>\n</div>",
